      "content": "It's not just a burden. It's a debt. They were my men, and I traded their lives for nothing. To just... stay here, to keep wearing this armor and eating their food, it feels like a mockery of what happened. Like I'm stealing life that should have belonged to them. There has to be a way to balance the scales. There has to be something a man like this can do to make it right.",
